      <title>ICE flight stranded at Portsmouth airport during Monday’s snowstorm has departed for Bulgaria</title>
      <link>https://www.nhpr.org/nh-news/2026-02-23/ice-detainees-plane-flight-portsmouth-airport-snowstorm-blizzard-nh-newhampshire</link>
      <description>The deportation flight was stuck on the tarmac for over 12 hours due to the blizzard. Detainees were eventually deplaned, fed, held in the terminal, and departed for Sofia, Bulgaria early Tuesday morning.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nhpr.org/nh-news/2026-02-23/ice-detainees-plane-flight-portsmouth-airport-snowstorm-blizzard-nh-newhampshire</guid>
